raw_discovery_candidates.cheap_validation:
Replicate on 400 or more post-cutoff Polymarket markets with timestamp-locked retrieval.

Pass bars:
(a) at least 10% Brier improvement over the same model as a single agent;
(b) the rho=1.0 ablation loses most of the gain (sanity check);
(c) the market blend has positive alpha with a CI excluding 0 at n >= 350.

Fail if the gain disappears under date-masked retrieval. Cost is tens of dollars on mini models.
